# Ke hoach da node theo phong: dua len git de thuc thi sau, co the tu may khac.
# Can CA HAI dong — mo lai thu muc truoc roi moi mo noi dung. Chi co dong thu hai
# thi git khong di vao thu muc da bi loai o tren va ngoai le khong bao gio chay.
!plans/260730-1836-da-node-theo-phong/
!plans/260730-1836-da-node-theo-phong/**
screenshots/*
docs/screenshots/*
docs/research/*
logs.txt
test-ck
__pycache__

# CK meta commands
prompt.md
ck.md

.gemini/settings.json
# python build artifacts
*.egg-info/

# Office: file khoa tam (~$...) va ban luu tu dong — sinh ra khi mo .pptx/.docx,
# khong phai noi dung, va bi khoa nen git thao tac loi.
#  Mau khong dua vao chu tieng Viet: ten file tu Windows co the o dang NFC hoac
#  NFD, hai chuoi byte khac nhau -> mau go dau se truot mot trong hai. Bat theo
#  dau ngoac vuong (Word/PowerPoint luon chen "[...]" vao ban luu tu dong).
~$*
*[[]*[]]*.pptx
*[[]*[]]*.docx

